  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added:\n- Cross-process append safety: multiple app instances sharing the same store directory are now safe (ADR-005)\n- CrossProcessLockManager with exponential backoff and OpossumOptions.CrossProcessLockTimeout (default: 5 s)\n- IEventStoreAdmin interface with DeleteStoreAsync — permanently removes all store data (events, indices, projections, ledger)\n- OpossumOptions.WriteProtectProjectionFiles — marks projection files read-only after every write (mirrors WriteProtectEventFiles)\n\nChanged:\n- WriteProtectEventFiles and WriteProtectProjectionFiles now default to false (opt-in for production)\n- Event and projection files now use pretty-printed (indented) JSON for human readability\n\nFixed:\n- Index files (event-type, tag) were not flushed to disk when FlushEventsImmediately = true — durability guarantee is now complete\n- DeleteStoreAsync race condition with concurrent AppendAsync — deletion now acquires the append lock\n- Flaky DescendingPerformanceTests integration test — warm-up pass added; ratio threshold widened to 4x\n\nPerformance:\n- Parallel index file loading in GetPositionsByEventTypesAsync / GetPositionsByTagsAsync (Task.WhenAll)\n- Reduced read-retry overhead: 3 retries / 1 ms back-off (was 5 / 10 ms)\n- Eliminated redundant File.Exists syscall per index file read\n- K-way sorted merge for multi-type/multi-tag position queries\n\nKnown Issues:\n- Crash-recovery position collision (pre-existing since v0.1.0) — tracked for 0.5.0\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/majormartintibor/Opossum/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
